{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-engineering","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 性能工程与优化方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing/performance-engineering","wordCount":2398,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士阶段-计算科学前沿-性能工程与优化方法论\">博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 性能工程与优化方法论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>性能工程不是代码写完后的&quot;调优&quot;环节，而是一种贯穿科学计算项目全生命周期的系统方法论。它的核心问题是：<strong>为什么我的程序没有达到硬件理论峰值？瓶颈在哪里？如何系统地消除它？</strong> 许多科学计算代码在实际运行中只利用了硬件峰值性能的 5-15%——这意味着通过性能工程获得 5-10 倍加速是完全现实的，而且不需要更换硬件。</p>\n<p>性能工程的基本方法论框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>测量先行（Measure First）</strong>：不要猜测瓶颈在哪里。使用性能剖析工具获取数据，让证据指导优化方向</li>\n<li><strong>Roofline 定位</strong>：确定程序是受计算限制、内存带宽限制还是延迟限制，针对不同瓶颈采用不同策略</li>\n<li><strong>自顶向下（Top-Down）分析</strong>：从应用层面开始（算法复杂度、并行效率），逐步深入到微架构层面（缓存命中率、指令流水线）</li>\n<li><strong>单一变量原则</strong>：每次只改变一个因素，测量其影响后再进行下一项优化</li>\n<li><strong>可回归性</strong>：保存每次优化的基准测试结果，确保新的优化不会意外破坏已有性能</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能问题] --&gt; B[测量与剖析]&#10;    B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型？}&#10;    C --&gt;|计算受限| D[向量化&lt;br&gt;算法优化&lt;br&gt;混合精度]&#10;    C --&gt;|带宽受限| E[缓存优化&lt;br&gt;数据布局&lt;br&gt;预取]&#10;    C --&gt;|延迟受限| F[并行化&lt;br&gt;重叠通信&lt;br&gt;流水线]&#10;    C --&gt;|并行效率| G[负载均衡&lt;br&gt;减少同步&lt;br&gt;扩大并行区域]&#10;    D --&gt; H[重新测量]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[性能问题] --&gt; B[测量与剖析]\n    B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型？}\n    C --&gt;|计算受限| D[向量化&lt;br&gt;算法优化&lt;br&gt;混合精度]\n    C --&gt;|带宽受限| E[缓存优化&lt;br&gt;数据布局&lt;br&gt;预取]\n    C --&gt;|延迟受限| F[并行化&lt;br&gt;重叠通信&lt;br&gt;流水线]\n    C --&gt;|并行效率| G[负载均衡&lt;br&gt;减少同步&lt;br&gt;扩大并行区域]\n    D --&gt; H[重新测量]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-性能剖析工具链\">一、性能剖析工具链</h3><p>性能分析的第一步是选择正确的工具。不同的工具揭示不同层次的信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>获取信息</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>time</code> / <code>perf stat</code></td>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>总执行时间、IPC、缓存命中率</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gprof</code> / <code>perf record</code></td>\n<td>函数层</td>\n<td>各函数的 CPU 时间占比、调用图</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel VTune</td>\n<td>微架构层</td>\n<td>流水线停顿原因、内存带宽利用率</td>\n<td>Intel CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nvprof</code> / Nsight Compute</td>\n<td>GPU 内核层</td>\n<td>占用率、访存效率、指令吞吐</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nsight Systems</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n<td>CPU-GPU 时间线、API 调用、数据传输</td>\n<td>NVIDIA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HPCToolkit</td>\n<td>全栈</td>\n<td>采样+追踪、归因到源代码行</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Score-P / Scalasca</td>\n<td>MPI+OpenMP</td>\n<td>通信模式、负载不均衡、等待时间</td>\n<td>HPC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自顶向下微架构分析（Top-Down Microarchitecture Analysis，TMA）</strong> 是 Intel 提出的系统化性能诊断方法。它将流水线占用分为四个顶层类别：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Slots</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Retiring</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Bad Speculation</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Frontend Bound</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Backend Bound</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Slots} = \\text{Retiring} + \\text{Bad Speculation} + \\text{Frontend Bound} + \\text{Backend Bound}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Slots</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Retiring</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bad Speculation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Frontend Bound</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Backend Bound</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>Retiring</strong>：成功执行并提交的指令占比——越高越好</li>\n<li><strong>Bad Speculation</strong>：因分支预测错误被丢弃的指令——减少条件分支或重组分支顺序</li>\n<li><strong>Frontend Bound</strong>：指令获取和解码的瓶颈——通常因指令缓存未命中</li>\n<li><strong>Backend Bound</strong>：指令已解码但无法执行——通常因数据缓存未命中或执行单元繁忙</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-缓存优化与数据布局\">二、缓存优化与数据布局</h3><p>现代处理器的内存层次结构使得数据访问模式对性能的影响远大于计算本身。L1 缓存访问延迟约 1 ns，DRAM 访问延迟约 100 ns——差距 100 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>空间局部性优化</strong>：确保顺序访问的数据在内存中也是连续存储的。经典案例是矩阵乘法中的循环顺序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 差：按列遍历 B，缓存不友好 (C/row-major)&#10;for (i) for (j) for (k) C[i][j] += A[i][k] * B[k][j];&#10;&#10;// 好：交换 j 和 k 循环，B 按行遍历&#10;for (i) for (k) for (j) C[i][j] += A[i][k] * B[k][j];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 差：按列遍历 B，缓存不友好 (C/row-major)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (j) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k) </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i][k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[k][j];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好：交换 j 和 k 循环，B 按行遍历</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (j) </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i][k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[k][j];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>循环交换后，B 矩阵的访问从步长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的列访问变为步长为 1 的行访问，缓存命中率显著提升。</p>\n<p><strong>数据布局转换（AoS → SoA）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// AoS (Array of Structures) — 缓存不友好的向量化&#10;struct Particle { double x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, mass; };&#10;Particle particles[N];&#10;&#10;// SoA (Structure of Arrays) — 向量化友好&#10;struct Particles {&#10;    double x[N], y[N], z[N];&#10;    double vx[N], vy[N], vz[N];&#10;    double mass[N];&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// AoS (Array of Structures) — 缓存不友好的向量化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Particle { double x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, mass; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Particle particles[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// SoA (Structure of Arrays) — 向量化友好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Particles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    double x[N], y[N], z[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    double vx[N], vy[N], vz[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    double mass[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当计算只需要 <code>x, y, z</code> 坐标时，SoA 布局将相关数据打包在连续内存中，每条缓存行都装满有用数据；AoS 布局则将无关的速度和质量字段也加载进缓存。</p>\n<p><strong>循环分块（Loop Tiling）</strong> 是矩阵运算的核心优化。将大循环拆分为小块，使工作集完全装入缓存：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Block size </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>sizeof(double)</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>cache_size</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Block size } B: B^2 \\times 3 \\times \\text{sizeof(double)} \\leq L1\\_\\text{cache\\_size}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Block size </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof(double)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">1_</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cache_size</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 32 KB L1 缓存，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\approx 36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span>（三个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36 \\times 36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 双精度矩阵块恰好填满 L1）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-向量化-simd-并行\">三、向量化：SIMD 并行</h3><p>现代 CPU 的 SIMD（单指令多数据）单元可以在一条指令中对多个数据元素执行相同操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SIMD 指令集</th>\n<th>向量宽度</th>\n<th>一次处理 FP64</th>\n<th>理论加速</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSE2</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVX2</td>\n<td>256 bit</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVX-512</td>\n<td>512 bit</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARM SVE</td>\n<td>可变 (128-2048 bit)</td>\n<td>2-32</td>\n<td>2-32x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自动向量化</strong>依赖编译器识别可向量化的循环。使用 <code>-O3 -march=native</code> 启用最高级别的自动向量化，配合编译器报告（<code>-fopt-info-vec</code> for GCC, <code>-qopt-report</code> for ICC）检查哪些循环成功向量化。</p>\n<p><strong>向量化的障碍</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>障碍</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据依赖</td>\n<td><code>a[i] = a[i-1] + b[i]</code></td>\n<td>算法重写消除依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非对齐访问</td>\n<td>数组起始地址不对齐</td>\n<td><code>__attribute__((aligned(64)))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件分支</td>\n<td><code>if (x[i] &gt; 0) ...</code></td>\n<td>掩码操作 <code>_mm256_blendv_pd</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数调用</td>\n<td>循环内调用 <code>sin()</code></td>\n<td>使用 SVML 向量数学库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非单位步长</td>\n<td><code>a[2*i]</code></td>\n<td>gather/scatter 指令或数据重排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-并行效率与可扩展性分析\">四、并行效率与可扩展性分析</h3><p>并行程序的效率随核心数增加而下降，关键是量化这种下降并找到原因。</p>\n<p><strong>强扩展性（Strong Scaling）</strong>：固定问题规模，增加处理器数。加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(P) = T_1/T_P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(P) = S(P)/P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>。Amdahl 定律给出上界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\max} = \\frac{1}{f_s + (1 - f_s)/P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是串行分数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 时最大加速比为 100，与处理器数量无关。</p>\n<p><strong>弱扩展性（Weak Scaling）</strong>：问题规模与处理器数成正比增长。理想情况下执行时间恒定。Gustafson 定律更乐观：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(P) = P - f_s(P - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>并行效率损失的来源</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>负载不均衡</td>\n<td>最慢进程等待时间</td>\n<td>动态调度、重新分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信开销</td>\n<td>通信时间/总时间</td>\n<td>通信-计算重叠、聚合小消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步等待</td>\n<td>barrier 等待时间</td>\n<td>异步算法、减少同步点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>串行瓶颈</td>\n<td>Amdahl 串行分数</td>\n<td>算法改写消除串行依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>性能模型</strong>可以预测扩展行为而不需要在目标规模上实际运行。LogP/LogGP 模型将通信参数化为延迟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>）、开销（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>）、间隙（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>）和处理器数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>），基于这些参数预测集合通信的时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-自动调优与性能可移植\">五、自动调优与性能可移植</h3><p>手动优化高度依赖硬件细节，换一种处理器可能需要重新调优。自动调优工具通过系统搜索参数空间来找到最佳配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ATLAS/BLIS</strong>：自动调优线性代数库，通过运行时基准测试确定最佳分块大小和循环展开因子</li>\n<li><strong>FFTW</strong>：FFT 库通过&quot;planner&quot;在首次运行时测试数百种算法变体，选择最快的方案</li>\n<li><strong>Kokkos/RAJA</strong>：可移植性能框架在编译时根据目标架构选择后端和优化策略</li>\n<li><strong>ytopt/GPTune</strong>：基于贝叶斯优化的自动调参工具，适用于黑盒性能函数</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>性能可移植性</strong>的目标是写一次代码，在多种硬件上都能达到接近峰值的性能。这需要将&quot;做什么&quot;（算法逻辑）和&quot;怎么做&quot;（执行策略）分离：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"算法描述（平台无关）&#10;  → 执行策略（Kokkos::parallel_for 的 execution space）&#10;    → 硬件后端（CUDA / HIP / OpenMP / SYCL）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>算法描述（平台无关）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 执行策略（Kokkos::parallel_for 的 execution space）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 硬件后端（CUDA / HIP / OpenMP / SYCL）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>TMA 实操</strong>：在你的 Linux 工作站上使用 <code>perf stat -d</code> 运行你的科学代码。检查 IPC（instructions per cycle）、L1/LLC 缓存命中率和分支预测命中率。哪个指标最低？它指示什么类型的瓶颈？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>缓存实验</strong>：编写一个矩阵-向量乘法，矩阵大小从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64 \\times 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8192</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8192</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8192 \\times 8192</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8192</span></span></span></span></span>。绘制 FLOP/s 随问题规模变化的曲线。找出性能急剧下降的点——它对应 L1、L2 还是 L3 缓存溢出？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>向量化报告</strong>：使用 GCC 的 <code>-fopt-info-vec-missed</code> 编译你的计算热点函数。编译器报告了哪些向量化失败的原因？你能通过代码重写消除这些障碍吗？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>扩展性测试</strong>：将你的 MPI 程序在 1、2、4、8、16、32 个进程上运行。绘制强扩展性曲线（加速比 vs 进程数）和并行效率曲线。在哪个进程数上效率低于 70%？瓶颈是通信还是负载不均衡？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思考题</strong>：为什么许多高性能计算中心仍然使用 Fortran 编写核心计算内核，尽管 C++ 和 Python 生态更丰富？从编译器优化、数组语义和历史代码库的角度分析。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>性能工程教科书</strong>：Hager 和 Wellein 的 &quot;Introduction to High Performance Computing for Scientists and Engineers&quot;（2010）系统覆盖了从缓存优化到并行效率的核心主题</li>\n<li><strong>TMA 方法</strong>：Yasin 的 &quot;A Top-Down Method for Performance Analysis and Counters Architecture&quot;（ISPASS, 2014）提出了 Intel 的自顶向下微架构分析框架</li>\n<li><strong>自动调优</strong>：Balaprakash 等人 &quot;Autotuning in High-Performance Computing Applications&quot;（PIEEE, 2018）综述了 HPC 中的自动调优方法</li>\n<li><strong>性能可移植性</strong>：Deakin 等人 &quot;Performance Portability across Diverse Computer Architectures&quot;（P3HPC, 2019）评估了多种可移植框架在不同架构上的表现</li>\n<li><strong>实践指南</strong>：Gorelick 和 Ozsvald 的 &quot;High Performance Python&quot; 虽然针对 Python，但其性能分析方法论（profiling → bottleneck → optimize → measure）适用于任何语言</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>性能工程是&quot;测量 → 分析 → 优化 → 验证&quot;的迭代循环。性能剖析工具提供诊断数据，Roofline 模型和 TMA 框架指导瓶颈分类，缓存优化、向量化和并行效率提升是三大优化支柱。最重要的原则是<strong>测量先行</strong>——不要凭直觉猜测瓶颈，让数据说话。在异构计算时代，性能可移植性工具（Kokkos、RAJA）和自动调优方法使得&quot;写一次、快到哪&quot;成为可能，但前提是研究者理解底层的性能原理。一个能系统地分析和优化计算性能的博士生，在实验室中的价值远超一个只会调用库函数的程序员。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 性能工程与优化方法论","id":"博士阶段-计算科学前沿-性能工程与优化方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、性能剖析工具链","id":"一-性能剖析工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"二、缓存优化与数据布局","id":"二-缓存优化与数据布局"},{"level":3,"text":"三、向量化：SIMD 并行","id":"三-向量化-simd-并行"},{"level":3,"text":"四、并行效率与可扩展性分析","id":"四-并行效率与可扩展性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"五、自动调优与性能可移植","id":"五-自动调优与性能可移植"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 异构计算与加速器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing/heterogeneous-computing-architectures"},"next":{"title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 物理信息神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/scientific-machine-learning/physics-informed-neural-networks"}}